Modifications made by Contorch (2026-10-12):
  * Weight-only quantization with onnxruntime's MatMulNBitsQuantizer
    (block size 32, symmetric, accuracy_level 4):
      - the token-embedding Gather -> 4-bit (GatherBlockQuantized), axis 1
      - every MatMul -> 8-bit MatMulNBits, axis 0
  * Saved with all tensors in one external data file, eg2-mixed.onnx_data.
  * No other change to the graph, the tokenizer or the vocabulary.

Measured against the original fp32 model on 221 texts: cosine similarity of
the 768-d embeddings 0.993 minimum / 0.999 mean.

